    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c37a1db66e31b10",
      "translationZh": "一条命令即可在本地运行（会下载模型并打开一个小型网页界面）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19efaa047e0b627d",
      "translationZh": "一年前，我在这个 subreddit 上发布了 Sopro V1，这是我作为业余项目、花了约 $250 训练的一个小型 TTS。它不太稳定，只支持英语，还有很多不完善的地方。Sopro V2 是一个投入了更多算力和研究工作的新版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4144b38d3e143de0",
      "translationZh": "sopro-v2-turbo：120M 参数，Apache-2.0 许可证，可根据 5-20 秒的参考音频进行零样本声音克隆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0f1b576e34c824f",
      "translationZh": "支持英语、欧洲葡萄牙语、法语、德语。据我所知，这是首个原生面向欧洲葡萄牙语（而非巴西葡萄牙语）的开放 TTS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbb410acdbedd334",
      "translationZh": "流式输出：在 M3 CPU 上，首段音频延迟约为 300 毫秒，实时率为 0.21 RTF；在 H100 上为 0.07 RTF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66cc03ff815575ce",
      "translationZh": "在 Seed-TTS-eval test-en 上，它的 WER 达到 1.51-1.65，可与规模为其 3-14 倍的模型竞争（F5-TTS 为 1.83，CosyVoice 3 为 2.02，Spark-TTS 为 1.98）。完整表格、音频样例以及架构与训练背后的故事都在博客文章中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11f6ba9ef9004227",
      "translationZh": "博客文章（评测、样例、工作原理）：https://research.haloneuro.ai/posts/sopro-v2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "782a2b4e4b39a5ca",
      "translationZh": "权重：https://huggingface.co/samuel-vitorino/sopro-v2-turbo",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
